OL,4,CUS Army to detonate explosives       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe US Army plans to move ahead with W5
OL,7,Gdetonating five tonnes of degraded   W5
OL,8,Gexplosives in Iowa despite a ruling  W5
OL,9,Gto halt it indefinitely, a new court W5
OL,10,Gfiling shows.                        W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,G"To protect its personnel and the    W5
OL,13,Gsurrounding communities, the Army    W5
OL,14,Gneeds to take swift action," the     W5
OL,15,Gjustice department notified the      W5
OL,16,Gcourt on Saturday. "Protection of    W5
OL,17,Ghuman health and the environment     W5
OL,18,Gdemand action now, not delay."       W5
